{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ · %@": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@ · %@ · %@": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%lld pages": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld page"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld pages"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld Seite"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld Seiten"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file with this name already exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Datei mit diesem Namen gibt es schon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add folder…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordner hinzufügen …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amount": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Betrag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any folder from the Files app works, also on a USB stick or in iCloud Drive. iOS syncs folders in iCloud Drive like any other file there; the app itself uploads nothing. Swipe to remove a folder from the list, the files stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeder Ordner aus der Dateien-App geht, auch auf einem USB-Stick oder in iCloud Drive. Ordner in iCloud Drive synchronisiert iOS wie jede andere Datei dort; die App selbst lädt nichts hoch. Zum Entfernen aus der Liste wischen, die Dateien bleiben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is reading document %lld of %lld…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence liest Dokument %lld von %lld …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is reading the document…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence liest das Dokument …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is still getting ready (downloading its model). Try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence wird noch eingerichtet (lädt sein Modell). Versuch es später noch mal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence reads title, sender, date and amount. Runs on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence liest Titel, Absender, Datum und Betrag. Läuft auf diesem iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abbrechen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certificate": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bescheinigung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a folder and a name, then tap Scan. The camera finds the page on its own and takes the picture. Each scan becomes a searchable PDF in the folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordner und Namen wählen, dann auf Scannen tippen. Die Kamera findet die Seite selbst und löst aus. Jeder Scan wird ein durchsuchbares PDF im Ordner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose another folder…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anderen Ordner wählen …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
